{"task_id": "HumanEval/76", "solution": "def is_simple_power(x, n):\n    \"\"\"Checks if x is a simple power of n (n**k == x for k >= 0).\n    Handles edge cases for n=0, n=1, x=0, x=1 as specified in the design.\"\"\"\n    if n == 1:\n        return x == 1\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return x == 0\n\n    if x == 1:\n        return True\n\n    if x == 0:\n        return False\n\n    current_power = 1\n    while current_power < x:\n        current_power *= n\n        if current_power == x:\n            return True\n        if current_power > x:\n            return False\n\n    return False"}
