{"task_id": "HumanEval/84", "solution": "def solve(N):\n    \"\"\"Computes the sum of the decimal digits of N and returns it as a binary string.\n    Assumes N is a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    total = 0\n    n = N\n\n    while n > 0:\n        total += n % 10\n        n //= 10\n\n    return bin(total)[2:]"}
