{"task_id": "HumanEval/117", "solution": "def select_words(s, n):\n    \"\"\"Given a string s and a natural number n, returns a list of words from s\n    containing exactly n consonants, preserving order and casing.\"\"\"\n\n    if not s or not s.strip():\n        return []\n\n    vowels = {'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'}\n    words = s.split()\n    result = []\n\n    for word in words:\n        count = 0\n        for ch in word:\n            if ch.lower() not in vowels:\n                count += 1\n\n        if count == n:\n            result.append(word)\n\n    return result"}
